# Hual04c carry-in combat/escort route (UU/seconds), appended to the re-timed prefix.
# Time shifts the prefix's descent so the carried loadout fights from the canyon floor.
# Real SelectWeapon exits the Hook item mode and picks the carried Beretta (group2); the
# north approach selects the carried M16 (group11) to clear the manonhighspotleft sniper.
# No teleports, grants, health writes or control overrides; only the game's own corpse
# QuickHeal medkit is used. The route clears the first encounter (soldier28/29/30), the
# second wave (2/31/32/33) and the BaseSoldier1 high-spot sniper, reaches Carrington, and
# retreats south at low HP; the escort then waits on the northern kill event (see the test).
#
# item107e: every recorded track/fire volley is a closed-loop named standing engagement. The
# route's contact schedule is tied to the game's own wave/escort timing, so the engagement must
# not pause the script clock: `engage_on <Actor>` turns to and taps that pinned soldier while
# the goto/reload/heal/strafe lines below keep their recorded times.
t=84.00 select_weapon 2
t=86.00 select_weapon 2
# item107e: the first encounter's recorded track/fire volley is two named standing engagements
# (the old switch at 92). Naming the target keeps the route's walking schedule (the goto/heals
# below still run on the script clock) while the player turns to and taps each pinned soldier.
t=90.00 engage_on BaseSoldier30 4000 aim=0.90 period=0.4
t=92.00 engage_on BaseSoldier29 4000 aim=0.90 period=0.4
t=94.00 engage_off
t=94.00 goto -3100 580
t=94.20 reload
t=96.00 heal
t=97.00 heal
t=98.00 heal
t=98.00 forward 0
# item104: BaseSoldier28 (bazooka, 2400 UU away at (-4861,-1065)) fires a rocket every ~2 s from about t=97.7
# (impacts measured at 100.27, 102.05, 104.58: 46/73/46 hp). The player crouches (hypothesis: lower
# dispersion) and engages as soon as the heals finish.
t=98.00 crouch 1
# item107e: BaseSoldier28 (aimed at the measured 1.20 height) then the second-wave bazooka soldier
# BaseSoldier2 (stationary at (-3906,-2278), launches from about 101.7) are named standing
# engagements, so the recorded strafe still dodges the rockets and the clock keeps running.
t=98.30 engage_on BaseSoldier28 5000 aim=1.20 period=0.3
t=100.30 engage_on BaseSoldier2 5000 aim=0.90 period=0.4
t=102.30 right 1
t=107.00 right 0
t=107.00 crouch 0
t=107.00 engage_off
t=107.00 goto -1500 1800
t=110.00 goto -844 2066
t=113.00 forward 0
t=113.00 reload
t=114.50 crouch 1
t=115.00 engage_on BaseSoldier33 4000 aim=0.90 period=0.4
t=118.00 engage_on BaseSoldier31 4000 aim=0.90 period=0.4
# item104: the carried Beretta is empty by here; the 32 engagement uses the carried M16 (the
# old fire on `BaseSoldier32` hit nothing: `TakeDamage` trace). BaseSoldier32 walks around to
# (-1083,1762) and is only in sight later; the standing engagement opens fire when it appears.
t=120.50 engage_off
t=121.00 select_weapon 11
t=123.00 engage_on BaseSoldier32 5000 aim=0.90 period=0.3
t=130.50 engage_off
t=130.00 crouch 0
t=130.00 reload
t=130.70 goto -53 2835
t=133.70 forward 0
t=134.70 track Cine0 0.60
# item104: the old goto -1062 2400 sequence wedges at (-854.6,2473.1) in the friction world (it slid on to
# (-860,2468) before); take the measured working waypoints (-789,2520) -> (-977,2404) -> (-1062,2400).
t=140.70 goto -789 2520
t=143.70 goto -977 2404
t=145.70 forward 0
t=145.70 track Cine0 0.90
t=146.20 crouch 1
t=149.70 goto -1062 2400
t=156.70 forward 0
t=156.70 crouch 0
t=156.70 track Cine0 0.90
t=158.70 goto -1062 2100
t=163.70 forward 0
t=163.70 track Cine0 0.90
t=164.70 goto -1342 2069
t=170.70 select_weapon 11
t=172.70 goto -1907 1912
t=174.20 goto -1939 1902
t=174.70 engage_on BaseSoldier1 4000 aim=0.85 period=0.3
t=180.70 engage_off
t=180.70 reload
t=182.70 goto -2370 2236
t=205.70 goto -2277 2766
t=225.70 goto -1994 3048
t=232.70 goto -1925 3800
t=248.70 goto -1257 4979
# item97d probe: the trailing `goto` must complete (within 24 UU) before `track` can own
# the aim; -1257 4979 is the measured stable track point. Clear the end-of-track assault
# (BaseSoldier34 Beretta first, then BaseSoldier35 Bazook) with the carried M16.
t=256.70 select_weapon 11
t=257.20 crouch 1
t=257.70 engage_on BaseSoldier34 5000 aim=0.6 period=0.2
t=260.50 engage_on BaseSoldier35 5000 aim=0.6 period=0.2
t=272.70 engage_off
t=272.70 crouch 0
# item97e: follow the escort's action89 moveseq north by dense gotos to m29 (within 1200 UU
# of the action92 `wait player 1200` point m30) so that gate clears; the escort then
# advances to action107 `wait event tupeuxyallerthird`. Clear the first action93
# `Bastardsinyourback` ambusher (BaseSoldier36) and heal from its corpse medkit. The route
# stops before the second ambusher (BaseSoldier37) can wear the carried player down. No
# teleports; only goto/track/forward/engage/heal.
t=273.20 goto -842 5359
t=274.70 goto -238 5949
t=276.20 goto 997 6711
t=278.90 goto 2218 6565
t=280.70 forward 0
t=280.80 select_weapon 11
t=281.20 engage_on BaseSoldier36 5000 aim=0.9 period=0.15
t=286.70 engage_off
t=286.90 heal
t=290.70 wait_travel
